 "measures": [
  {
   "name": "Sumner-Fredericksburg Community School District Public Measure BW",
   "jurisdiction": "Sumner-Fredericksburg Community School District (Chickasaw County portion)",
   "ballotLanguage": "Shall the Board of Directors of the Sumner-Fredericksburg Community School District in the Counties of Bremer, Chickasaw, and Fayette, State of Iowa, be authorized to contract indebtedness and issue General Obligation Bonds in an amount not to exceed $16,300,000 to provide funds to construct, build, furnish, and equip additions to the High School building; and to remodel, repair, improve, and equip the existing High School, Middle School, and Fredericksburg Elementary buildings, including playground, parking, and site improvements?"
  }
 ],
 "notes": "Candidates from the official Chickasaw County 2026 general election candidate list (text PDF); seat counts for SWCD (vote for two) and Ag Extension (vote for five) and the public measure text were read from the scanned precinct sample ballots (image PDFs). Supervisors are elected by district: District 2 and District 5 seats are on separate ballot styles (e.g., Fredericksburg precinct shows only District 5); voters see only their district. 'No Candidate' listings (Democratic Treasurer/Attorney; several township offices) are recorded as empty candidate lists (write-in only). Township seat counts are not stated on the candidate list, so they are null. Sumner-Fredericksburg CSD Public Measure BW appears on 8 of 31 ballot styles; no other local measures. No county hospital trustee race."
